    <node id="MPA-701ca8645ddafa02ee5f">
      <data key="d0">evidence</data>
      <data key="d14">MPA-701ca8645ddafa02ee5f</data>
      <data key="d15">MP015</data>
      <data key="d16">33</data>
      <data key="d17">https://www.spxflow.com/assets/original/johnson-pump-im-fre-gb.pdf</data>
      <data key="d18">SPX_FLOW__JOHNSON_PUMP</data>
      <data key="d19">Take adequate measures to avoid that the motor is started while you are
                       working on the pump. This is especially important for electric motors with
                       remote control:                                            
                       • Switch the operating switch near the pump (if available) to "OFF".
                       • Switch off the pump switch on the switchboard.           
                                                                                  
                       • If necessary remove the fuses.                           
