      <data key="d18">ABS</data>
      <data key="d19">Hydraulic lock may occur where a piping system is arranged such that malfunctions (for example,
                 in directional valves or in the valve control) can cause power units to work in a closed circuit
                 against each other rather than in parallel delivering fluid to the rudder actuator, thus resulting in
